{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04957","headline":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制 · 马怀素","name":"奉和圣制春日幸望春宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩仗琱舆俯碧浔，行春御气发皇心。\n摇风细柳萦驰道，映日轻花出禁林。\n遍野园亭开帟幕，连堤草树狎衣簪。\n谬参西掖沾尧酒，愿沐南薰解舜琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马怀素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}